{"id":"n15974-1-7","stage":2,"title":"매번 · 每次","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15974-1-7-1","ko":"유민이는 또 늦네.","zh":"裕敏又迟到了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이는","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦네.","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]}],"audio":"/audio/58891c78042d6dcc6aa1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15974-1-7-2","ko":"유민이는 약속에 매번 늦는 습관은 좀 고쳐야 돼.","zh":"裕敏每次约会都迟到，这个习惯得改改了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이는","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"약속에","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매번","meaning":"每次","explanation":"매번：每次","readings":[{"term":"매번","audio":"/audio/677c3d1e8dbd1d1a91b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15974","senseId":"1","lemma":"매번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦는","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"습관은","meaning":"习惯","explanation":"습관：习惯；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"습관","audio":"/audio/04694ae7655dfa6742aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65105","senseId":"1","lemma":"습관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고쳐야","meaning":"改正，纠正","explanation":"고치다：改正，纠正；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"고치다","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18381","senseId":"3","lemma":"고치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"677c3d1e8dbd1d1a","term":"매번","zh":"每次","audio":"/audio/677c3d1e8dbd1d1a91b7.mp3","entryId":"15974","definition":"每当发生什么事情的时候。","pronunciation":["매ː번"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"04694ae7655dfa67","term":"습관","zh":"习惯","audio":"/audio/04694ae7655dfa6742aa.mp3","entryId":"65105","definition":"在长时间重复的过程中自然熟悉的行动方式。","pronunciation":["습꽌"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"7